    <updated>2026-08-29T23:16:54.916Z</updated>
    
    
    <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;Due to concerns about my privacy and personal safety, I have decided
to stop updating my personal blog, effective immediately and until
further notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recent circumstances have made me feel that my online activity is
being tracked and monitored. This has begun to affect my sense of safety
and my daily life. To avoid exposing further personal information, I
will not share additional details. I also ask that people refrain from
seeking, tracking, or circulating information about my whereabouts or
private life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you to everyone who has read and supported my work. At this
time, I need to prioritize my safety, and I hope that my decision and
personal boundaries will be respected.&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
    
    
    
    
